# Environment
.env

# Bismuth runtime state (a vault's own .bismuth/ dir lives with the vault,
# not in this repo -- this only guards against accidentally committing a
# scratch vault used during development).
/scratch/
/vault/
*.bismuth-vault/

# Team operating notes -- ownership map, each member's git identity, and the
# branch/commit conventions that go with them. Local to this team.
/TEAM.md
/docs/git-workflow.md

# Working notes for the agents that develop this repository, and the tuning
# harness they drive. What the repository must be true to is SPEC.md and
# docs/adr/; these are the scaffolding used to get there, and they carry
# corpus-specific paths, round-by-round scores and abandoned experiments that
# would read as decisions to anyone else.
/CLAUDE.md
/HANDOFF.md
/docs/agent-plan.md
/docs/ralf-handoff.md
/docs/ralph/
/docs/eval/
/docs/troubleshooting/
/docs/adr/archive/
/scripts/
/tests/test_log_analysis.py
/tests/test_compare_vaults.py

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
/examples/demo-vault/

# Debug logs (per-run, regenerated)
/logs/

# Local agent handoff and one-off experiment process artifacts
/NEXT_AGENT_HANDOFF.md
/.codex-*.err
/.codex-*.out
/.codex-*.json
